==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Lacking Sources|AoC}}
Wildberries are a [[Material]] in {{AoC}}. They can be obtained by defeating generic enemy [[Rito]] units and their captains.

Wildberries are used for completing [[Side Quest|Quests]], to be used by the blacksmiths in the [[Hylian Blacksmith Guild]] to break [[Sealed Skill]]s on [[Weapon]]s, or to be used in specific [[Cooking]] recipes to make combat-boosting [[Food]] that call for their usage.
{{Noncanon|End}}

